-- SECTION 7: END-TO-END SEMANTIC SPEND SOUNDNESS (OWNERSHIP, MERKLE
-- MEMBERSHIP, NULLIFIER UNIQUENESS & INTEGER CONSERVATION UNDER ASSERTIONS)
